"description":"Keep your house flipping projects on track with FlipperForce Field! This mobile app is designed for FlipperForce users, project managers, and contractors to effortlessly post real-time project updates and photos directly from their phones or tablets. Stay informed and keep everyone on the same page, no matter where you are.\n\n\n\nFeatures Included:\n\n- Post project updates: Share progress, communicate important information, and keep your team informed with quick text updates.\n- Post project photos: Capture and upload job site photos instantly to document progress, highlight issues, or showcase completed work.\n- Seamless integration with FlipperForce web app: All updates and photos posted in the field are instantly synced with your FlipperForce web account, providing a centralized view of your projects.\n- Live updates and photo feeds: Stay in the loop with real-time feeds for every project, ensuring you always have the latest information and visual progress.\n- Simple interface: An intuitive design makes it easy for anyone to quickly post updates and photos without a steep learning curve.\n- Easy login for project managers / contractors: Provide simple and secure access for your team members to contribute to project updates.", "minimumOsVersion":"15.6", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "bundleId":"com.flipperforce", "userRatingCount":3}]
